/* Hoenn & Seek 2.1-08: SILVER's milestone teams for his Indigo Plateau rematch (and his
   Hoenn appearance). src/hoenn_silver.c picks one by your progress; levels are placeholders
   (HoennScaledAce's top-90 ladder sets the ace, gaps kept). Team names follow HnS's
   TRAINER_RIVAL_<X>_7_HNS: CHIKORITA's has Meganium, CYNDAQUIL's Typhlosion, TOTODILE's
   Feraligatr. Tiers: 1 Kanto champion, 2 four Hoenn badges, 3 Wallace beaten, 4 Brendan & May
   beaten. */

